        "source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "source.start" "1"
        "source.end" "6"
        "title" "3. Classes"
        "heading.level" "2"
        "heading.slug" "3-classes"
        "section" "Overview"
        "note.001.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.001.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.001.text" "Format per class: **id** — one-line definition. `versions`. Property table. Instances file."
        "note.001.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.002.text" "Player intentions and their lifecycle live only in [controls](controls.dsl); physical bindings"
        "note.001.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.003.text" "and current adapter coupling live only in [controller profiles](controller-profiles.dsl)."
        "note.001.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.001.source.start" "3"
        "note.001.source.end" "5"
    }
}

