        "property.007.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "property.007.source.start" "149"
        "property.007.source.end" "149"
        "property.007.type.state" "absent-column"
        "property.007.i-e.state" "absent-column"
        "property.007.notes.state" "text"
        "property.007.notes.text" "S: dungeon under some 5★ villages holding an artifact"
        "property.007.value.state" "absent-column"
        "property.008.name" "petrified"
        "property.008.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "property.008.source.start" "150"
        "property.008.source.end" "150"
        "property.008.type.state" "absent-column"
        "property.008.i-e.state" "absent-column"
        "property.008.notes.state" "text"
        "property.008.notes.text" "bool, S: witch curse until witch killed"
        "property.008.value.state" "absent-column"
        "property.009.name" "possessed"
        "property.009.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "property.009.source.start" "151"
        "property.009.source.end" "151"
        "property.009.type.state" "absent-column"
        "property.009.i-e.state" "absent-column"
        "property.009.notes.state" "text"
        "property.009.notes.text" "bool, S: demon portal active in land"
        "property.009.value.state" "absent-column"
        "property.010.name" "layout"
        "property.010.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "property.010.source.start" "152"
        "property.010.source.end" "152"
        "property.010.type.state" "absent-column"
        "property.010.i-e.state" "absent-column"
        "property.010.notes.state" "text"
        "property.010.notes.text" "hybrid (D22): one per land from the land seed, terrain flattened under `design.settlement.radius`, box buildings on a ring, one NPC per service building; numbers `design.settlement`"
        "property.010.value.state" "absent-column"
        "note.002.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.002.source.start" "141"
        "note.002.source.end" "152"
        "note.003.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.003.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.001.text" "**Hybrid settlements item 1 (owner approved, 2026-09-27):** exactly one settlement per land"
        "note.003.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.002.text" "is the final target, not a temporary limit pending multiple settlements. Other D22 layout,"
        "note.003.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.003.text" "services and settlement-safety rules are unchanged. Live `rulesets.json#ruleset-hybrid.flags`"
        "note.003.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.004.text" "still says `settlements-per-land: \"many\"`; flag migration and enforcement remain deferred."
        "note.003.line.005.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.005.text" "`design.settlement.per-land` already equals 1; the current validator only checks ≥1."
        "note.003.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.003.source.start" "154"
        "note.003.source.end" "158"
        "note.004.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.004.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.001.text" "D22's box-building ring and service coverage are slice approximations, not the final layout:"
        "note.004.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.002.text" "districts, procedural rooms/roofs, villagers/schedules, specialization changes, sewers/dens"
        "note.004.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.003.text" "and the flight master are outside that slice, not permanently banned. Layout, landscape colours,"
        "note.004.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.004.text" "door NPCs, interaction range and spawn-safety tuning remain in `design.settlement` and"
        "note.004.line.005.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.005.text" "`ui.json#screens.npc-service`."
        "note.004.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.004.source.start" "160"
        "note.004.source.end" "164"
        "note.005.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.005.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.005.line.001.text" "Hybrid village-curse state is world-shared and persistent under `save-data` item 4."
        "note.005.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.005.line.002.text" "Settlement-style records are hybrid configuration under §5 Validation-contract mapping item 1."
        "note.005.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.005.source.start" "166"
        "note.005.source.end" "167"
    }
}

