        "property.005.name" "night"
        "property.005.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "property.005.source.start" "227"
        "property.005.source.end" "227"
        "property.005.type.state" "absent-column"
        "property.005.i-e.state" "absent-column"
        "property.005.notes.state" "absent-column"
        "property.005.value.state" "text"
        "property.005.value.text" "very dark; lanterns; stealth builds faster in darkness"
        "property.006.name" "weather"
        "property.006.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "property.006.source.start" "228"
        "property.006.source.end" "228"
        "property.006.type.state" "absent-column"
        "property.006.i-e.state" "absent-column"
        "property.006.notes.state" "absent-column"
        "property.006.value.state" "text"
        "property.006.value.text" "none in A/S; Ω: rain, snow, moving clouds, freezing water"
        "note.002.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.002.source.start" "221"
        "note.002.source.end" "228"
        "note.003.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.003.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.001.text" "**Hybrid world/reset item 3 (owner approved, 2026-09-28):** defeated enemies, **including"
        "note.003.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.002.text" "bosses**, in **ordinary dungeons and repeatable daily encounters** return with the daily reset."
        "note.003.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.003.text" "Enemies belonging to a **completed one-time objective stay cleared**, including its guards"
        "note.003.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.004.text" "and boss. Enemy resets **never renew an artifact or book claim**: personal source claims and"
        "note.003.line.005.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.005.text" "world-shared improvements retain their approved scopes and reset rules (`save-data`, items 4–5)."
        "note.003.line.006.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.006.text" "Tomorrow may offer another daily boss fight, but never recreate a completed supplier-rescue"
        "note.003.line.007.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.007.text" "encounter. Daily-enemy eligibility does not change other mechanics' resets or reward rules."
        "note.003.line.008.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.008.text" "Live-data/checker migration and reset/save implementation remain deferred and unauthorized."
        "note.003.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.003.source.start" "230"
        "note.003.source.end" "237"
        "note.004.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.004.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.001.text" "**Hybrid world/reset item 4 (owner approved, 2026-09-28):** an **occupied dungeon/quest"
        "note.004.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.002.text" "site waits until all players leave** before applying its pending daily refresh, using item 3's"
        "note.004.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.003.text" "eligibility. **Multiple missed midnights produce one refresh**, never stacked waves. The clock"
        "note.004.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.004.text" "change itself **never heals or replaces living enemies or erases an ongoing fight**; a run"
        "note.004.line.005.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.005.text" "spanning midnight can finish without defeated guards respawning behind the party. Ordinary"
        "note.004.line.006.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.006.text" "threat decay, targeting and home-return rules remain unchanged (`ai-behavior`): genuine mob"
        "note.004.line.007.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.007.text" "death/respawn starts fresh, not a clock-triggered wipe of surviving mobs. No site radius,"
        "note.004.line.008.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.008.text" "occupancy grace period or storage format is chosen. Occupancy/reset enforcement is deferred."
        "note.004.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.004.source.start" "239"
        "note.004.source.end" "246"
        "note.005.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.005.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.005.line.001.text" "**Hybrid settlements/inn item 2 (owner approved, 2026-09-27):** inn recovery fully heals and"
        "note.005.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.005.line.002.text" "sets the respawn point **for free at any time**. A separate sleep service costs **10 copper**,"
        "note.005.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.005.line.003.text" "is available **18:00–06:00**, and skips the clock to the **next 07:00**: 22:00 reaches tomorrow"
        "note.005.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.005.line.004.text" "morning; 02:00 reaches that morning. This is a clock skip, not fast-forwarded combat, status"
        "note.005.line.005.state" "text"
        "note.005.line.005.text" "effects or cooldowns. The sleep hours and fee do not restrict free recovery."
        "note.005.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.005.source.start" "248"
        "note.005.source.end" "252"
        "note.006.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.006.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.006.line.001.text" "**Hybrid settlements/inn item 3 (owner approved, 2026-09-27; depends on item 2):** apply"
        "note.006.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.006.line.002.text" "ordinary midnight resets **once when the skip crosses midnight**. Sleeping at 23:00 crosses"
        "note.006.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.006.line.003.text" "midnight; sleeping at 02:00 does not. Sleeping itself grants **no extra shop refresh or mission"
        "note.006.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.006.line.004.text" "reroll**. Cleared dungeon/quest enemy eligibility and occupied-site timing follow world/reset"
        "note.006.line.005.state" "text"
        "note.006.line.005.text" "items 3–4 above."
        "note.006.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.006.source.start" "254"
        "note.006.source.end" "258"
        "note.007.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.007.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.007.line.001.text" "**Hybrid settlements/inn item 4 (owner approved, 2026-09-27; depends on item 2):** **all"
        "note.007.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.007.line.002.text" "connected players must explicitly agree** before the shared clock skips. The initiating player"
        "note.007.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.007.line.003.text" "pays the **single 10-copper fee only when the skip succeeds**. A refusal blocks the skip and"
        "note.007.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.007.line.004.text" "nobody loses money. Free recovery needs no agreement. This specifies no voting timeout or"
        "note.007.line.005.state" "text"
        "note.007.line.005.text" "disconnect protocol."
        "note.007.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.007.source.start" "260"
        "note.007.source.end" "264"
        "note.008.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.008.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.008.line.001.text" "Documentation only: `design.settlement.inn` and current runtime still provide free recovery"
        "note.008.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.008.line.002.text" "without a clock/skip. The hybrid `inn-cost: 10` flag does not distinguish the two services;"
        "note.008.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.008.line.003.text" "`generators.json#time` and A/S inn records are not a complete hybrid service contract."
        "note.008.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.008.line.004.text" "The S sleep-specific refreshes in `economy.json#rules` / `npc-roles.json#innkeeper` are reference,"
        "note.008.line.005.state" "text"
        "note.008.line.005.text" "not hybrid policy. Live-data migration and runtime implementation remain deferred and unauthorized."
        "note.008.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.008.source.start" "266"
        "note.008.source.end" "270"
        "note.009.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.009.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.009.line.001.text" "**Hybrid persistence item 8 (owner approved, 2026-09-28):** a **shut-down world accumulates"
        "note.009.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.009.line.002.text" "no gameplay time**. Its clock and timed resets resume from saved time, without offline combat"
        "note.009.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.009.line.003.text" "or overnight reset catch-up. A dedicated server that remains running continues normally even"
        "note.009.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.009.line.004.text" "with nobody connected. This preserves D16's frozen distant movement/attacks and the approved"
        "note.009.line.005.state" "text"
        "note.009.line.005.text" "elapsed-gameplay-time threat/taunt timers (`ai-behavior`); it does not require simulating every"
        "note.009.line.006.state" "text"
        "note.009.line.006.text" "creature in an empty world. Approved inn sleep remains its distinct clock-skip rule above."
        "note.009.line.007.state" "text"
        "note.009.line.007.text" "No character-absent cooldown/status policy, serialization/checkpoint cadence or crash-recovery"
        "note.009.line.008.state" "text"
        "note.009.line.008.text" "policy is chosen. Clock/save implementation remains deferred and unauthorized."
        "note.009.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.009.source.start" "272"
        "note.009.source.end" "279"
    }
}

