r_stat = element "stat" "Class" {
    tags "Class,Combat"
    properties {
        "id" "stat"
        "kind" "Class"
        "order" "745"
        "source.commit" "175e0c59b6a05ead62d29bd851085cd5a3818378"
        "source.status" "historical baseline coordinates"
        "source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "source.start" "745"
        "source.end" "803"
        "title" "stat"
        "heading.level" "3"
        "heading.slug" "stat"
        "section" "Combat"
        "note.001.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.001.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.001.text" "Derived number on characters and items. `A S` → `instances/stats.json#stats`: hp, attack-power,"
        "note.001.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.002.text" "spell-power, armor, resistance, crit, haste (alpha \"tempo\"), regeneration (stamina only, D11),"
        "note.001.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.003.text" "mana-regeneration `A`, block-power, weapon-rating & armor-rating `S` (average star tier),"
        "note.001.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.004.text" "power-level `A`, movement speeds (climb, swim, dive, ride, glide, sail), light-radius."
        "note.001.line.005.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.005.text" "Rules: armor is subtractive with a 10 % floor (D15, `design.combat.armor-floor`); combo counter"
        "note.001.line.006.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.006.text" "ignores a growing share of armor; stats roughly double per rarity tier (display) vs ×2^0.25 in the"
        "note.001.line.007.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.007.text" "raw curve `?`."
        "note.001.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.001.source.start" "746"
        "note.001.source.end" "752"
        "note.002.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.002.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.002.line.001.text" "Hybrid **Resistance means magical-damage reduction, not general status immunity**. Resistance"
        "note.002.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.002.line.002.text" "alone does not prevent a magical hit's stun. Hazard-protection drinks keep their separate roles."
        "note.002.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.002.line.003.text" "Historical conflicting stat descriptions remain reference, not alternate hybrid behavior."
        "note.002.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.002.source.start" "754"
        "note.002.source.end" "756"
        "note.003.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.003.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.001.text" "**Hybrid Resistance item 1 (owner approved; recorded 2026-10-16):** subtract **1 damage per"
        "note.003.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.002.text" "Resistance point**, not a percentage. A 100-damage spell against 30 Resistance becomes **70"
        "note.003.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.003.text" "damage**, subject to item 2's minimum."
        "note.003.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.003.source.start" "758"
        "note.003.source.end" "760"
        "note.004.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.004.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.001.text" "**Hybrid Resistance item 2 (owner approved; recorded 2026-10-16):** Resistance alone cannot"
        "note.004.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.002.text" "reduce a damaging hit below **10% of its original damage**, matching armor's existing floor."
        "note.004.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.003.text" "For an eligible hit with incoming damage `D ≥ 0` and Resistance `R ≥ 0`, the Resistance-stage"
        "note.004.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.004.text" "result is `max(D - R, 0.1 × D)`. A 100-damage spell against 200 Resistance yields **10 damage**"
        "note.004.line.005.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.005.text" "at this stage. Zero damage stays zero; fractional damage remains possible, with **no minimum-one"
        "note.004.line.006.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.006.text" "rounding**. This is not a final HP-loss floor: later defences may reduce or absorb the remainder."
        "note.004.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.004.source.start" "762"
        "note.004.source.end" "767"
        "note.005.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.005.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.005.line.001.text" "**Hybrid Resistance item 3 (owner approved; recorded 2026-10-16):** classify the **attack**,"
        "note.005.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.005.line.002.text" "not merely its attacker:"
        "note.005.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.005.line.003.text" "- **Magical:** Mage weapon attacks, damaging Mage spells and enemy mage-role spells."
        "note.005.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.005.line.004.text" "- **Physical:** weapon blows, bites, arrows, thrown weapons and physical strike skills."
        "note.005.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.005.source.start" "769"
        "note.005.source.end" "772"
        "note.006.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.006.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.006.line.001.text" "Apply **exactly one equipment defence**: magical attacks use Resistance under items 1–2;"
        "note.006.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.006.line.002.text" "physical attacks use the existing armor rules, never armor followed by Resistance. A mage's"
        "note.006.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.006.line.003.text" "fireball meets Resistance; an ordinary arrow meets armor. This selects no new attack content"
        "note.006.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.006.line.004.text" "or live-data migration and does not extend combo armor penetration to Resistance."
        "note.006.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.006.source.start" "774"
        "note.006.source.end" "777"
        "note.007.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.007.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.007.line.001.text" "**Hybrid Resistance item 4 (owner approved; recorded 2026-10-16):** damage-over-time calculated"
        "note.007.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.007.line.002.text" "from a triggering hit inherits that hit's Resistance reduction **once**. Never subtract Resistance"
        "note.007.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.007.line.003.text" "again on each tick. If a fire spell falls from 100 to 70 damage, burning worth 10% of that hit"
        "note.007.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.007.line.004.text" "starts at **7 per tick**, not 10 followed by another Resistance subtraction."
        "note.007.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.007.source.start" "779"
        "note.007.source.end" "782"
        "note.008.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.008.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.008.line.001.text" "Independently sourced poison and environmental hazards gain **no Resistance protection** under"
        "note.008.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.008.line.002.text" "this selection. Preserve existing status identity, application and duration, dodge exceptions,"
        "note.008.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.008.line.003.text" "drinks and status-protection rules. The example selects no new tick coefficient, duration or"
        "note.008.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.008.line.004.text" "cadence; no additional DOT buff timing, stacking/slot model or hazard behavior is selected."
        "note.008.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.008.source.start" "784"
        "note.008.source.end" "787"
        "note.009.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.009.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.009.line.001.text" "Items 1–3 determine the triggering hit's Resistance reduction; item 5 governs its defence stage."
        "note.009.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.009.source.start" "789"
        "note.009.source.end" "789"
        "note.010.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.010.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.010.line.001.text" "**Hybrid Resistance item 5 (owner approved; recorded 2026-10-16):** apply Resistance first,"
        "note.010.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.010.line.002.text" "then existing block and damage-reduction multipliers, then absorption shields. The **10% floor"
        "note.010.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.010.line.003.text" "applies only at the Resistance stage**, not to final HP loss; absorption may prevent all HP loss."
        "note.010.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.010.source.start" "791"
        "note.010.source.end" "793"
        "note.011.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.011.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.011.line.001.text" "Example: **100 → 70** through Resistance → **14** through blocking → **7** during Bulwark."
        "note.011.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.011.line.002.text" "Separately, a Mage's 50-point absorption shield facing that resisted 70-damage hit leaves"
        "note.011.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.011.line.003.text" "**20 HP damage**."
        "note.011.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.011.source.start" "795"
        "note.011.source.end" "797"
        "note.012.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.012.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.012.line.001.text" "Items 1–2 define the first stage; item 3 limits its coverage. Preserve existing block"
        "note.012.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.012.line.002.text" "eligibility/exhaustion, multiplier values, absorption-pool rules and status protections."
        "note.012.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.012.line.003.text" "The examples select no new block/buff strengths or shield capacities."
        "note.012.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.012.line.004.text" "Implementation and live-data/checker changes remain separately unauthorized."
        "note.012.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.012.source.start" "799"
        "note.012.source.end" "802"
    }
}

