        "note.002.source.start" "806"
        "note.002.source.end" "817"
        "note.003.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.003.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.001.text" "Runtime (D21): every class node and ultimate has a `design.abilities` entry naming one of six runtimes (dash, channel,"
        "note.003.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.002.text" "burst, buff, heal, projectile — D24: shots along the aim; a dash may `throw` shots first) with its numbers, cost (mp / stamina, a number or `all`) and cooldown; strikes apply the ability's"
        "note.003.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.003.text" "`applies` through `design.status-effects` (`c-ability-runtime`). Shared-column skills have no runtime here (swimming scales"
        "note.003.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.004.text" "swim speed; pet, mount, climb, glider, boat wait for their systems)."
