        "note.002.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.002.source.start" "827"
        "note.002.source.end" "835"
        "note.003.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.003.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.001.text" "**Hybrid Wand item 1 (owner approved, 2026-09-28):** a wand is **mechanically two-handed**,"
        "note.003.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.002.text" "even if held visually in one hand. Equip one wand with **no other hand item**, including a"
        "note.003.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.003.text" "second wand or bracelet; the pose grants no off-hand capacity. Preserve its Mage restriction,"
        "note.003.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.004.text" "existing damage (`damage-k: 8`), beam attacks, combo rules and **32-cube upgrade limit**."
        "note.003.line.005.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.005.text" "Under D6's existing two-handed size class, a **common wand costs 20 wood cubes at a workbench**"
        "note.003.line.006.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.006.text" "(`5 × 4`), with existing rarity-gem requirements unchanged. This selects a complete two-handed"
        "note.003.line.007.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.007.text" "loadout, not a one-handed pairing or a new damage/upgrade exception."
        "note.003.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.003.source.start" "837"
        "note.003.source.end" "843"
        "note.004.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.004.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.001.text" "Documentation only: live `weapon-types.json#wand.hands` still says `1h (2h in wiki)`, parsed"
        "note.004.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.002.text" "as one-handed, and `recipes.json#gear-weapons.wand` still lists 10 wood cubes. Those provisional"
        "note.004.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.003.text" "values do not override this rule. Live-data migration, equipment/crafting/customization enforcement"
        "note.004.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.004.text" "and validation coverage remain separately deferred and unauthorized."
        "note.004.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.004.source.start" "845"
        "note.004.source.end" "848"
        "note.005.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.005.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.005.line.001.text" "Hybrid (D24): `design.movesets.<weapon-type>.m1|m2` gives every class weapon its runtime — melee sphere (swing / radius mults,"
        "note.005.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.005.line.002.text" "spin around the player, lunge, finisher status), projectile (count, spread, speed, gravity, life, hit radius, splash, pierce,"
        "note.005.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.005.line.003.text" "return), beam (instant ray) or at-cursor (sphere where the aim lands); `c-moveset-config`. Data channels `m1`/`m2` mean basic/special attacks, never device bindings."
        "note.005.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.005.line.004.text" "Crossbow bolts fly flat and fast. The live `design.movesets.crossbow` gravity of **3** does not"
        "note.005.line.005.state" "text"
        "note.005.line.005.text" "override that approved trajectory; tuning alignment remains deferred, not authorized here."
        "note.005.line.006.state" "text"
        "note.005.line.006.text" "Animations/hit timing, boomerang steering, held-ray Wand special attack, Bow dud shots and arrow pickup"
        "note.005.line.007.state" "text"
        "note.005.line.007.text" "are outside the D24 slice, not final exclusions. Creature projectiles use D26's"
        "note.005.line.008.state" "text"
        "note.005.line.008.text" "`design.creature-roles`, not the player movesets."
        "note.005.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.005.source.start" "850"
        "note.005.source.end" "857"
        "note.006.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.006.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.006.line.001.text" "Hybrid (D25): `design.feel.events` bundles feedback per combat event (hit-stop, camera trauma, sound, damage number,"
        "note.006.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.006.line.002.text" "impact flash) — hit, crit, kill, hurt, block, dodge, shoot, impact; `c-feel-config`."
        "note.006.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.006.line.003.text" "Tuning and shake, number, trail and impact behavior live in `generators.json#design.feel`."
        "note.006.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.006.line.004.text" "Real audio assets, particles beyond sphere stand-ins, animations/hit timing and a reduce-shake /"
        "note.006.line.005.state" "text"
        "note.006.line.005.text" "reduce-flash accessibility screen are outside this slice, not permanent exclusions; design numbers"
        "note.006.line.006.state" "text"
        "note.006.line.006.text" "are tuning knobs, not a prohibition on later accessibility UI."
        "note.006.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.006.source.start" "859"
        "note.006.source.end" "864"
    }
}

r_combo_system = element "combo-system" "Class" {
    tags "Class,Combat"
    properties {
        "id" "combo-system"
        "kind" "Class"
        "order" "866"
        "source.commit" "175e0c59b6a05ead62d29bd851085cd5a3818378"
        "source.status" "historical baseline coordinates"
        "source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "source.start" "866"
        "source.end" "888"
        "title" "combo-system"
        "heading.level" "3"
        "heading.slug" "combo-system"
        "section" "Combat"
        "note.001.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.001.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.001.text" "Hit counter near cursor; +1 per landed hit; ignores growing share of armor and adds damage; any"
        "note.001.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.002.text" "whiffed attack resets; expires ~5 s idle; transfers between targets; per-weapon cap (turns blue with"
        "note.001.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.003.text" "\"!\"); enemies do the same. `A S`"
        "note.001.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.001.source.start" "867"
        "note.001.source.end" "869"
        "note.002.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.002.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.002.line.001.text" "Hybrid damaging-channel miss boundary (walkthrough item 10, owner approved 2026-09-17): judge"
        "note.002.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.002.line.002.text" "one whole channel, not individual ticks. Empty ticks do not trigger a miss reset. When the"
        "note.002.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.002.line.003.text" "channel ends, including an early end, reset combo for a miss only if no hit landed during that"
        "note.002.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.002.line.004.text" "channel. Normal inactivity expiry still applies throughout; successful-hit combo gains and"
        "note.002.line.005.state" "text"
        "note.002.line.005.text" "per-weapon caps are unchanged."
        "note.002.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.002.source.start" "871"
        "note.002.source.end" "875"
        "note.003.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.003.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.001.text" "Hybrid zero-damage taunts (walkthrough item 10, owner approved 2026-09-17) are combo-neutral:"
        "note.003.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.002.text" "they neither increase nor reset combo, and do not refresh its inactivity timer, whether or not"
        "note.003.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.003.text" "any enemy is affected. Normal inactivity expiry still applies. Existing taunt/healing effects"
        "note.003.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.004.text" "are unchanged; this does not settle threat amounts or targeting rules."
        "note.003.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.003.source.start" "877"
        "note.003.source.end" "880"
        "note.004.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.004.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.001.text" "Class-ability combo runtime authorization (walkthrough item 10, owner approved 2026-09-17):"
        "note.004.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.002.text" "repair missing non-projectile class-strike combo handling and add regressions for the above"
        "note.004.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.003.text" "rules. Reuse the existing landed-hit gain, inactivity timer and weapon cap; preserve damage,"
        "note.004.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.004.text" "costs, cooldowns, taunt/healing effects and projectile/weapon attack behavior. Empty channel"
        "note.004.line.005.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.005.text" "ticks never reset combo; a wholly missed damaging channel resets on normal or early end."
        "note.004.line.006.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.006.text" "Zero-damage taunts remain neutral even with no targets. No other deferred work is authorized."
        "note.004.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.004.source.start" "882"
        "note.004.source.end" "887"
    }
}

