        "note.001.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.001.text" "[Dodge (locator=dodge)](controls.dsl) while moving: roll with i-frames (not vs spike traps / dagger poison), costs 25 stamina (25 %),"
        "note.001.line.002.state" "text"
