        "property.008.i-e.state" "absent-column"
        "property.008.notes.state" "empty-cell"
        "property.008.value.state" "absent-column"
        "property.009.name" "land"
        "property.009.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "property.009.source.start" "984"
        "property.009.source.end" "984"
        "property.009.type.state" "text"
        "property.009.type.text" "`land` ref"
        "property.009.i-e.state" "absent-column"
        "property.009.notes.state" "text"
        "property.009.notes.text" "S: origin region (region lock)"
        "property.009.value.state" "absent-column"
        "property.010.name" "plus"
        "property.010.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "property.010.source.start" "985"
        "property.010.source.end" "985"
        "property.010.type.state" "text"
        "property.010.type.text" "bool"
        "property.010.i-e.state" "absent-column"
        "property.010.notes.state" "text"
        "property.010.notes.text" "S: `+` suffix; works in adjacent lands"
        "property.010.value.state" "absent-column"
        "property.011.name" "name"
        "property.011.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "property.011.source.start" "986"
        "property.011.source.end" "986"
        "property.011.type.state" "text"
        "property.011.type.text" "derived"
        "property.011.i-e.state" "absent-column"
        "property.011.notes.state" "text"
        "property.011.notes.text" "`item-name` generator"
        "property.011.value.state" "absent-column"
        "note.002.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.002.source.start" "974"
        "note.002.source.end" "986"
        "note.003.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.003.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.001.text" "D18's damage/armor-only gear stats are slice coverage, not a permanent exclusion of HP,"
        "note.003.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.002.text" "regeneration, tempo or crit."
        "note.003.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.003.source.start" "988"
        "note.003.source.end" "989"
        "note.004.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.004.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.001.text" "**Hybrid gear HP:** otherwise-identical existing HP-bearing gear has a **fixed HP bonus**,"
        "note.004.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.002.text" "independent of modifier roll:"
        "note.004.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.004.source.start" "991"
        "note.004.source.end" "992"
        "note.005.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.005.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.005.line.001.text" "`HP bonus = curve(n, rarity) × 5 × slot × (2 + materialBonus)`"
        "note.005.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.005.source.start" "994"
        "note.005.source.end" "994"
        "note.006.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.006.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.006.line.001.text" "Use the unchanged [Alpha base curve (locator=6-generators)](6_Generators.dsl), with"
        "note.006.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.006.line.002.text" "`n = level + 0.1 × upgrade_count`; rarity is distinct from the normalized modifier roll."
        "note.006.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.006.line.003.text" "This applies only to existing HP-bearing weapons, chest, shoulders, gloves and boots:"
        "note.006.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.006.line.004.text" "`slot = 1` for chest, `0.5` for those other pieces. Material bonus is **iron 1, cotton 0.75,"
        "note.006.line.005.state" "text"
        "note.006.line.005.text" "linen 0.5, otherwise 0**. No jewelry HP, random HP allocation or clamp is added."
        "note.006.line.006.state" "text"
        "note.006.line.006.text" "This new hybrid simplification removes only the disputed HP modifier-roll term, not the"
        "note.006.line.007.state" "text"
        "note.006.line.007.text" "level/rarity/cube curve; it is not a recovered Alpha formula. Historical evidence, all other"
        "note.006.line.008.state" "text"
        "note.006.line.008.text" "stat rules and downstream character/artifact rules remain unchanged. Gear HP application"
        "note.006.line.009.state" "text"
        "note.006.line.009.text" "is deferred, not a live negative-HP bug."
        "note.006.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.006.source.start" "996"
        "note.006.source.end" "1004"
    }
}

