        "source.status" "historical baseline coordinates"
        "source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "source.start" "1013"
        "source.end" "1017"
        "title" "rarity"
        "heading.level" "3"
        "heading.slug" "rarity"
        "section" "Items"
        "note.001.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.001.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.001.text" "7 tiers: worn `S` (grey; degraded), common (white ★), uncommon (green ★★, emerald), rare (blue"
        "note.001.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.002.text" "★★★, sapphire), epic (purple ★★★★, ruby, named), legendary (yellow ★★★★★, diamond, named),"
        "note.001.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.003.text" "mythical `A X` (bug). Same scale colours enemies and missions. → `instances/rarities.json`."
        "note.001.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
