        "note.001.line.001.text" "Food (sit, immobile, heal over 15 s), potion (channel while moving), elixir `S` (10 min +20 % stat),"
        "note.001.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.002.text" "beverage `S` (10 min hazard resistance), bomb (100-HP fuse \"pet\" entity, breaks boulders, chains,"
        "note.001.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.003.text" "hurts players; A +1/+5/+10). → `instances/consumables.json` with recipes."
        "note.001.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.004.text" "Heal formula A: `item-base-hp(n, rarity) × 200` (life/cactus potion, ginseng soup, snowberry mash,"
        "note.001.line.005.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.005.text" "mushroom spit) or `× 100` (pineapple slice, pumpkin muffin)."
        "note.001.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.001.source.start" "1053"
        "note.001.source.end" "1057"
    }
}

