        "source.commit" "175e0c59b6a05ead62d29bd851085cd5a3818378"
        "source.status" "historical baseline coordinates"
        "source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "source.start" "1062"
        "source.end" "1074"
        "title" "recipe"
        "heading.level" "3"
        "heading.slug" "recipe"
        "section" "Items"
        "note.001.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.001.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.001.text" "Inputs → output at a station. `A S` → `instances/recipes.json` (gear quantity table by rarity ×"
        "note.001.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.002.text" "slot, food, potions, elixirs, beverages, refining, rings/amulets, water flask)."
        "note.001.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.001.source.start" "1063"
        "note.001.source.end" "1064"
        "note.002.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.002.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.002.line.001.text" "**Hybrid books/formulas item 2 (owner approved, 2026-09-28):** books and formulas teach into"
        "note.002.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.002.line.002.text" "one character recipe collection (`known-recipes` / `knows-recipe`), not separate source-specific"
        "note.002.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.002.line.003.text" "unlocks. Learning the same recipe twice grants nothing extra. A book teaches **only its unknown"
        "note.002.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.002.line.004.text" "recipes**, with **no rerolls or compensation** for known ones; four recipes with three already"
        "note.002.line.005.state" "text"
        "note.002.line.005.text" "known teach one. Attempting to learn an **already-known formula leaves the scroll unconsumed**."
        "note.002.line.006.state" "text"
        "note.002.line.006.text" "Overlap can make later books less rewarding. This chooses no recipe-generation or identity defaults."
        "note.002.line.007.state" "text"
        "note.002.line.007.text" "A known recipe need not be usable: book-recorded recipes may be power-locked (`power-gate`, item 3)."
        "note.002.line.008.state" "text"
        "note.002.line.008.text" "Live-data migration and recipe-learning implementation remain deferred."
        "note.002.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.002.source.start" "1066"
        "note.002.source.end" "1073"
    }
}

