        "heading.level" "3"
        "heading.slug" "option"
        "section" "Meta"
        "note.001.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.001.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.001.text" "→ `instances/ui.json#options`: FPS limit (default 111), invert Y, camera speed, resolution,"
        "note.001.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.002.text" "windowed, render distance, AA samples (`options.cfg`), rarity display, music loop `S`, volumes,"
        "note.001.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.003.text" "UI/minimap presentation options. No physical defaults are defined here; see"
        "note.001.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.004.text" "[controller profiles](controller-profiles.dsl)."
        "note.001.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.001.source.start" "1458"
        "note.001.source.end" "1461"
    }
}

r_save_data = element "save-data" "Class" {
    tags "Class,Meta"
    properties {
        "id" "save-data"
        "kind" "Class"
        "order" "1463"
        "source.commit" "175e0c59b6a05ead62d29bd851085cd5a3818378"
        "source.status" "historical baseline coordinates"
        "source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "source.start" "1463"
        "source.end" "1504"
        "title" "save-data"
        "heading.level" "3"
        "heading.slug" "save-data"
        "section" "Meta"
        "note.001.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.001.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.001.text" "A: `Save/characters.db` (sqlite `blobs(key,value)`; character blob ≈ EntityData), per-world"
        "note.001.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.002.text" "`world.db` (discovered map); assets `data1.db`/`data2.db`; characters world-independent."
        "note.001.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.003.text" "S: per-world sqlite (`world_db_database`), Steam Cloud listed. Pets' XP didn't persist in"
        "note.001.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.001.line.004.text" "multiplayer `A`."
        "note.001.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.001.source.start" "1464"
        "note.001.source.end" "1467"
        "note.002.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.002.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.002.line.001.text" "**Hybrid persistence item 1 (owner approved, 2026-09-28):** a hero carries their identity,"
        "note.002.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.002.line.002.text" "level/XP, skills, inventory, equipment, money, recipes, acquired key items, artifacts and pets,"
        "note.002.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.002.line.003.text" "**including pet progression**, between solo worlds and servers. These remain that character's"
        "note.002.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.002.line.004.text" "progress; other characters do not inherit them automatically. Experienced heroes can enter"
        "note.002.line.005.state" "text"
        "note.002.line.005.text" "fresh worlds with their existing strength. Equipment never weakens on travel (§1)."
        "note.002.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.002.source.start" "1469"
        "note.002.source.end" "1473"
        "note.003.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.003.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.001.text" "**Hybrid persistence item 2 (owner approved, 2026-09-28):** position, respawn point,"
        "note.003.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.002.text" "travel unlocks and lore are saved **per character per saved world**, separate from portable"
        "note.003.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.003.text" "progression. Returning restores that world's records; first entry uses its starting location"
        "note.003.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.004.text" "under the existing D22 `world.spawn-rule`, not a new spawn policy. Independently created worlds"
        "note.003.line.005.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.005.text" "have separate mutable histories even when their seeds match. Seed equality determines generation"
        "note.003.line.006.state" "text"
        "note.003.line.006.text" "and geography, **not saved-world identity**; no storage format or identity-allocation scheme is chosen."
        "note.003.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.003.source.start" "1475"
        "note.003.source.end" "1480"
        "note.004.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.004.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.001.text" "**Hybrid persistence item 4 (owner approved, 2026-09-28):** supplier rescues, removed"
        "note.004.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.002.text" "barriers and resolved village curses belong to **that saved world**, not the character who"
        "note.004.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.003.text" "completed them. Their effects benefit everyone there, including later arrivals, and survive"
        "note.004.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.004.text" "sessions **subject to each mechanic's existing reset rules**. Visitors inhabit one consistent"
        "note.004.line.005.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.005.text" "world and may find these objectives already completed. This persistence rule sets no new reset"
        "note.004.line.006.state" "text"
        "note.004.line.006.text" "schedule; cleared dungeon/quest enemy eligibility follows `game-clock` world/reset item 3."
        "note.004.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.004.source.start" "1482"
        "note.004.source.end" "1487"
        "note.005.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.005.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.005.line.001.text" "**Hybrid persistence item 5 (owner approved, 2026-09-28):** each character may claim a"
        "note.005.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.005.line.002.text" "given **artifact or one-time book source once in that saved world**. Another character's claim"
        "note.005.line.003.state" "text"
        "note.005.line.003.text" "does not consume theirs; later visitors can still collect their own **at the source**, not by"
        "note.005.line.004.state" "text"
        "note.005.line.004.text" "automatic remote award. Leaving, restarting or returning never renews an existing claim;"
        "note.005.line.005.state" "text"
        "note.005.line.005.text" "neither do daily enemy resets (`game-clock`, world/reset item 3)."
        "note.005.line.006.state" "text"
        "note.005.line.006.text" "Genuinely separate worlds, including independently created matching-seed worlds, offer additional"
        "note.005.line.007.state" "text"
        "note.005.line.007.text" "sources; item 1's portable heroes can therefore earn additional artifacts by world-hopping."
        "note.005.line.008.state" "text"
        "note.005.line.008.text" "Existing recipe-duplicate rules still apply (`recipe`): no compensation, rerolls or account-wide"
        "note.005.line.009.state" "text"
        "note.005.line.009.text" "knowledge. Ordinary ground loot is unchanged; this is not a blanket all-reward instancing rule."
        "note.005.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.005.source.start" "1489"
        "note.005.source.end" "1497"
        "note.006.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.006.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.006.line.001.text" "World time across shutdown follows `game-clock` item 8; surviving logical mobs"
        "note.006.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.006.line.002.text" "retain threat/order/neutral provocation across restart under `ai-behavior` item 9."
        "note.006.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.006.source.start" "1499"
        "note.006.source.end" "1500"
        "note.007.kind" "paragraph"
        "note.007.line.001.state" "text"
        "note.007.line.001.text" "Documentation only: save-data and networking are unimplemented; these policies do not authorize"
        "note.007.line.002.state" "text"
        "note.007.line.002.text" "runtime, live-data, model/loader/validator or test changes."
        "note.007.source.file" "3_Classes.md"
        "note.007.source.start" "1502"
        "note.007.source.end" "1503"
    }
}

